{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29240","headline":"陪少师李相国崔宾客宴居守狄仆射池亭 · 许浑","name":"陪少师李相国崔宾客宴居守狄仆射池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池色似潇湘，仙舟正日长。\n燕飞惊蛱蝶，鱼跃动鸳鸯。\n云聚歌初转，风回舞欲翔。\n暖醅松叶嫩，寒粥杏花香。\n罗绮留春色，笙竽送晚光。\n何须明月夜，红烛在华堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}